This idea occurred to me after reading an article about the supposed
properties of crystals in one of the NM papers (being near Santa Fe, I
see this stuff much too often).

Anyway, the new character would be a ``Crystal Rubber.''  The
character would start out with about a random gems.  The #rub command
could also be used on gems, but would have about as much effect as it
does with ordinary lamps.  But try telling that to the character.

A new command would also be added, #meditate.  This could be used, for
example, when being attacked by a monster.

The Mordor orc hits.
#meditate
You try to create a feeling of peace throughout the dungeon -more-
The Mordor orc laughs at you -more-
The Mordor orc hits -more-
...

One other thing:  these characters should always be charged high
prices for ordinary glass purchased from shops (e.g. 1000gp for an
ordinary piece of white glass).

